      "text": "This 12-day itinerary takes you from Brazil’s largest city to Iguazu Falls, then to Rio de Janeiro and along the Green Coast to Ilha Grande and Paraty. The trip combines big cities, national parks, islands, beaches and colonial architecture. This tour is planned for 2025."
